Z||000000||Shiner||06-13-2000||04:17 AM||||Welp, I went out after work to see gone in 60 seconds.  What a bitchen movie!  Everbody go see it now!  You will love how Nicky Cage evades helicopter persuit in his (stolen) Mustang GT500!  Be carefull though, because after watching this movie you may feel like trying to boost an old 'Cuda or something  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P> THEN, me and my friend head out for some late night coffee.  I needed to get on the other side of the divided road I was on, so I pulled a U-bee at an intersection (I didn't see any no u-turn signs, but I later found out there were FOUR, and I couldn't see even one of them because of the rain!  And, to top it off, the left-turn lane light was RED!  It was a real bone-headed maneuver, I will admit that.  And of course, Mr. Poeleece Ocifer pulls in behind me at the diner.  I only got a warning, and Mr. Man even asked how GI60S was!  Just goes to show you, there ARE some nice police out there.  But I don't think I would have gotten only a warning if I was driving my GT  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  ||||reg||1
